 Hanse Davion and the New Avalon court claiming his trial was unfairly biased against him due to his half Capellan heritage. Expelled from the Federated Suns and adopting his mother\'s maiden name \'Xiang,\' Justin entered the gladiatorial Solaris 7 games with the intent of publicly humiliating Hanse Davion at every opportunity with his now infamous Yen-Lo-Wang. Justin Xiang would eventually become the 3027 Solaris 7 champion after killing the reigning champion Philip Capet."),SelectedWeaponHardPoints=("Torso_Center_EH1_mediumlaser","Torso_Center_EH2_mediumlaser","Forearm_Right_BH1_Hero","Arm_Left_Medium_MeleeWeapon"),BlankWeaponHardPoints=("Torso_Left_MB1_blank"),bRecalculateFreeSlotsOnSave=True,EquipmentAllocation=(ArmorDataAssetId=(Id="MWArmorDataAsset:StandardArmor"),StructureDataAssetId=(Id="MWStructureDataAsset:StandardStructure"),AllowedHeatSinkType=(TagName="Equipment.HeatSinks.Single"),SlotData=((SlotTypeDataAssetId=(Id="MWSlotTypeDataAsset:General_SlotType"),SlotCounts=((Head, 1),(CenterTorso, 0),(LeftTorso, 12),(LeftArm, 6),(LeftLeg, 2),(RightTorso, 12),(RightArm, 3),(RightLeg, 2)))),InternalEquipment=(LifeSupport,Sensors,Cockpit,Gyro,LeftArm_Shoulder,LeftArm_UpperActuator,RightArm_Shoulder,RightArm_UpperActuator,LeftLeg_Hip,LeftLeg_UpperActuator,LeftLeg_LowerActuator,LeftLeg_FootActuator,RightLeg_Hip,RightLeg_UpperActuator,RightLeg_LowerActuator,RightLeg_FootActuator),OtherCompatibilities=(KelMechEquipmentCompatibilityFunction_TechBase'"KelMechEquipmentCompatibilityFunction_TechBase_1"'),TotalTraitSlots=9),RefitCosts=(Id="MWMechRefitCostsDataAsset:CN9_200_Std_RefitCosts"),EngineRating=200,BaseChassisCost=2672499,SalvageShareCost=25,bIsHeroMech=True)
